{{!
    @template mod_zoom/pooled_date_input

    Date input for a pooled occurrence slot (occurrence table and planner).

    A native date input gives a real calendar picker (weekdays visible), but
    displays in the BROWSER's locale — an English-UI browser shows MM/DD/YYYY
    whatever Moodle's language is. So the input travels with companions: the
    weekday label makes the schedule validatable at a glance, and the
    JJ/MM/AAAA text field plus calendar button (both hidden until the
    mod_zoom/occurrences module activates them) become the visible control —
    deterministic day/month/year everywhere — while the native input shrinks
    to an invisible value carrier whose picker opens from the button
    (showPicker()). Without JS the native input stays as-is.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name Input name.
    * value ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD) or empty.
    * weekday Short weekday label ('' when JS fills it in).
    * formid Optional owning form id (HTML5 form="" association).
    * required Whether the date is required.
    * hidden Whether the group renders pre-hidden (.zoom-occ-edit d-none).
    * extraclasses Optional extra classes on the group.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "newdate",
        "value": "2026-08-24",
        "weekday": "Mon",
        "formid": "zoom-occ-move-1",
        "required": true,
        "hidden": true,
        "extraclasses": ""
    }
}}
<div class="input-group d-inline-flex w-auto align-middle flex-nowrap{{#hidden}} zoom-occ-edit d-none{{/hidden}}{{#extraclasses}} {{extraclasses}}{{/extraclasses}}">
    <span class="input-group-text zoom-occ-weekday" data-zoom-occ-weekday="1" style="min-width:3.2em;justify-content:center">{{weekday}}</span>
    <input type="date" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}" class="form-control w-auto zoom-occ-date"
        {{#formid}}form="{{formid}}"{{/formid}} {{#required}}required{{/required}}>
    <input type="text" size="10" maxlength="10" placeholder="{{#str}} occ_dateformat, mod_zoom {{/str}}"
        inputmode="numeric" aria-label="{{#str}} occ_date, mod_zoom {{/str}}"
        class="form-control w-auto zoom-occ-datetext d-none">
    <button type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="{{#str}} calendar, calendar {{/str}}"
        class="btn btn-outline-secondary zoom-occ-datebtn d-none">{{#pix}} i/calendar, core {{/pix}}</button>
</div>
